ARCHIVE POLICY
--------------
- Release IDs are preserved for compatibility with mono-package-mgr.
- The latest release is appended at the end; entries are not duplicated.
- Commit references identify the original implementation work.
- Earlier entries may contain less detail because the source records were brief.
- Grouping and summaries are editorial; they do not imply additional testing.

