RELEASE HIGHLIGHTS
------------------
- Strengthened fuel transaction fiscalization and Tanzania-specific compliance workflows.
- Improved DOMS/JPL fuel pricing, product synchronization, and tank reporting.
- Improved receipt presentation, printing reliability, and local time handling.
- Improved reporting performance, transaction access, and PostgreSQL outage handling.
- Hardened runtime stability, deployment, and administrative maintenance.

